<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
    <meta name="rx-csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken || '' %>">
    <script>!function(){var t=localStorage.getItem("rxTheme");if(t)document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme",t)}();</script>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Call Center - Patient RX System</title>
    <link href="/assets/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/assets/inter.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fontawesome.all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        body.rx-call-center-page #content,
        body.rx-call-center-page .cc-copy-locked {
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -moz-user-select: none;
            -ms-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
        }
        body.rx-call-center-page input,
        body.rx-call-center-page textarea,
        body.rx-call-center-page select,
        body.rx-call-center-page button {
            -webkit-user-select: auto;
            -moz-user-select: auto;
            -ms-user-select: auto;
            user-select: auto;
        }
        .cc-toolbar {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 1fr) auto auto auto;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: end;
        }
        .cc-metrics {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .cc-metric {
            min-height: 92px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--card-bg, var(--surface));
            padding: 14px 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s, transform .15s;
        }
        .cc-metric:hover {
            border-color: #4a90e2;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .cc-metric.active {
            border-color: #4a90e2;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(74,144,226,.16);
        }
        .cc-metric:hover .cc-metric-icon {
            opacity: .85;
        }
        .cc-metric-icon {
            flex: 0 0 42px;
            width: 42px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            line-height: 1;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cc-metric-body {
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .cc-metric .label {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .03em;
        }
        .cc-metric .value {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .cc-metric-link {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: .72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .cc-list-subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .78rem;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .cc-table {
            table-layout: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            min-width: 1420px;
        }
        .cc-table th,
        .cc-table td {
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .cc-record-heading,
        .cc-record-line {
            display: grid;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .cc-record-heading-all,
        .cc-record-all {
            grid-template-columns:
                minmax(125px, 1fr)
                minmax(115px, .9fr)
                minmax(115px, .9fr)
                minmax(145px, 1.05fr)
                minmax(130px, 1.1fr)
                minmax(135px, .95fr)
                minmax(190px, 1.45fr)
                58px
                minmax(170px, 1.25fr)
                42px;
        }
        .cc-record-heading {
            padding: 6px 10px;
        }
        .cc-record-heading-cell,
        .cc-record-cell {
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .cc-record-heading-cell {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .72rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .cc-record-td {
            padding: 0 !important;
        }
        .cc-record-all {
            padding: 7px 10px;
            align-items: start;
            transition: background-color .15s ease;
        }
        .cc-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) .cc-record-all {
            background: rgba(25, 135, 84, .085);
            box-shadow: inset 4px 0 0 rgba(25, 135, 84, .7);
        }
        .cc-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) .cc-record-all {
            background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .14);
            box-shadow: inset 4px 0 0 rgba(74, 144, 226, .78);
        }
        .cc-table tbody tr:hover .cc-record-all {
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, .16);
            box-shadow: inset 4px 0 0 rgba(255, 193, 7, .9);
        }
        .cc-patient-full-name {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        .cc-record-cell-save {
            text-align: right;
        }
        .cc-name-cell {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }
        .cc-phone {
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .cc-clinic-name,
        .cc-patient-transport-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.3;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }
        .cc-phone-wrap {
            display: inline-grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 32px;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .cc-phone-action-stack {
            display: inline-flex;
            flex: 0 0 32px;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }
        .cc-call-link {
            position: relative;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            flex: 0 0 32px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid #198754;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(25, 135, 84, .1);
            color: #198754;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background-color .15s, color .15s, transform .15s;
        }
        .cc-call-link:hover,
        .cc-call-link:focus-visible {
            background: #198754;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .cc-call-link:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid rgba(25, 135, 84, .28);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }
        .cc-call-link.disabled {
            border-color: var(--border);
            background: rgba(108, 117, 125, .08);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            cursor: not-allowed;
            opacity: .55;
        }
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-active {
            border-color: #dc3545;
            background: rgba(220, 53, 69, .14);
            color: #dc3545;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-cooldown {
            border-color: #f59f00;
            background: rgba(245, 159, 0, .16);
            color: #b26a00;
            cursor: wait;
        }
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-active:hover,
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-active:focus-visible,
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-cooldown:hover,
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-cooldown:focus-visible {
            color: inherit;
            transform: none;
        }
        .cc-phone-lock-status {
            display: none;
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            max-width: 145px;
            margin-top: -4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .66rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .cc-phone-lock-status.visible {
            display: block;
        }
        .cc-phone-lock-status.active {
            color: #dc3545;
        }
        .cc-phone-lock-status.cooldown {
            color: #b26a00;
        }
        .cc-cooldown-countdown {
            display: none;
            position: absolute;
            top: -8px;
            right: -9px;
            min-width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            padding: 0 4px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 2px solid var(--card-bg, #fff);
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #f59f00;
            color: #212529;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, .2);
            font-size: .65rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }
        .cc-cooldown-countdown.visible {
            display: inline-flex;
        }
        .cc-row-hangup {
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid #dc3545;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #dc3545;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(220, 53, 69, .3);
        }
        .cc-row-hangup:hover,
        .cc-row-hangup:focus-visible {
            background: #bb2d3b;
            border-color: #b02a37;
        }
        .cc-row-hangup:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid rgba(220, 53, 69, .25);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }
        .cc-row-hangup:disabled {
            cursor: wait;
            opacity: .7;
        }
        .cc-softphone-help {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .78rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .cc-phone-client-status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            min-height: 28px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            background: rgba(108, 117, 125, .08);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .cc-phone-client-status.online {
            border-color: rgba(25, 135, 84, .42);
            background: rgba(25, 135, 84, .1);
            color: #198754;
        }
        .cc-phone-client-status.calling {
            border-color: rgba(13, 110, 253, .4);
            background: rgba(13, 110, 253, .1);
            color: #0d6efd;
        }
        .cc-phone-client-status.fallback {
            border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, .45);
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, .1);
            color: #b7791f;
        }
        .cc-called-wrap.rx-answered {
            border-color: #198754;
            background: rgba(25, 135, 84, .18);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(25, 135, 84, .08);
        }
        .cc-call-link.is-calling {
            background: #198754;
            color: #fff;
            animation: cc-phone-pulse 1.25s infinite;
        }
        .cc-call-link.cc-availability-active.is-calling {
            border-color: #dc3545;
            background: #dc3545;
            color: #fff;
        }
        @keyframes cc-phone-pulse {
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(25, 135, 84, .12); }
        }
        .cc-phone-setup-modal .modal-content {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--card-bg);
            color: var(--text-color);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, .28);
        }
        .cc-phone-setup-modal .modal-header,
        .cc-phone-setup-modal .modal-footer {
            border-color: var(--border);
        }
        .cc-phone-setup-modal .form-label {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .74rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: .04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .cc-registration-message {
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: .82rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .cc-registration-security {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .76rem;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }
        .cc-codec-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 7px;
        }
        .cc-codec-list .badge {
            border: 1px solid rgba(13, 110, 253, .25);
            padding: 7px 9px;
            background: rgba(13, 110, 253, .08) !important;
            color: var(--text-color) !important;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .cc-note-preview {
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-word;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: .82rem;
        }
        .cc-history-list {
            font-size: .78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.45;
        }
        .cc-row-note {
            height: 34px;
            min-height: 34px;
            resize: vertical;
        }
        .cc-called-wrap {
            width: 44px;
            height: 34px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: rgba(25, 135, 84, .08);
        }
        .cc-sort {
            border: 0;
            background: transparent;
            color: inherit;
            font: inherit;
            font-weight: 800;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: inherit;
        }
        .cc-sort i {
            opacity: .45;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }
        .cc-sort.active i {
            opacity: 1;
            color: #4a90e2;
        }
        .cc-pagination {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        @media (max-width: 1100px) {
            .cc-metrics { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(150px, 1fr)); }
            .cc-toolbar { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .cc-metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .cc-toolbar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="rx-call-center-page">
<div class="wrapper">
    <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>
    <div id="content" class="cc-copy-locked">
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg px-4 mb-3">
            <button type="button" id="sidebarCollapse" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" title="Menu">
                <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
            </button>
            <span class="ms-3 fw-bold fs-5"><i class="fas fa-headset me-2 text-info"></i>Call Center</span>
            <div class="ms-auto d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <button id="themeToggle" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" title="Theme"><i class="fas fa-moon"></i></button>
                <span id="userGreeting" class="text-muted small"></span>
                <button id="logoutBtn" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt me-1"></i>Logout</button>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="container-fluid px-4 pb-4">
            <div class="cc-metrics mb-3">
                <div class="cc-metric active" data-view="queue" data-card="queue" id="ccCardQueue">
                    <div class="cc-metric-icon" style="color:#198754"><i class="fas fa-user-check"></i></div>
                    <div class="cc-metric-body">
                        <div class="label">Call Queue</div>
                        <div class="value" id="ccMetricEligible">--</div>
                        <div class="text-muted small" id="ccEligibleWindowLabel">Calling from day <%= serviceWindowDays - callCenterLeadDays %> · Service eligible day <%= serviceWindowDays %></div>
                        <div class="cc-metric-link"><i class="fas fa-external-link-alt me-1"></i>View queue</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cc-metric" data-view="called-today" data-card="calls" id="ccCardCalls">
                    <div class="cc-metric-icon" style="color:#38bdf8"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i></div>
                    <div class="cc-metric-body">
                        <div class="label">Calls This Login</div>
                        <div class="value" id="ccMetricCalls">--</div>
                        <div class="cc-metric-link"><i class="fas fa-external-link-alt me-1"></i>View calls</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cc-metric" data-view="patients-called" data-card="patients" id="ccCardPatientsCalled">
                    <div class="cc-metric-icon" style="color:#4a90e2"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
                    <div class="cc-metric-body">
                        <div class="label">Patients This Login</div>
                        <div class="value" id="ccMetricUnique">--</div>
                        <div class="cc-metric-link"><i class="fas fa-external-link-alt me-1"></i>View patients</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cc-metric" data-view="service-dates-today" data-card="dates" id="ccCardServiceDates">
                    <div class="cc-metric-icon" style="color:#20c997"><i class="fas fa-calendar-plus"></i></div>
                    <div class="cc-metric-body">
                        <div class="label">Dates This Login</div>
                        <div class="value" id="ccMetricDates">--</div>
                        <div class="cc-metric-link"><i class="fas fa-external-link-alt me-1"></i>View dates</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="cc-metric" data-view="service-dates-today" data-card="efficiency" id="ccCardEfficiency">
                    <div class="cc-metric-icon" style="color:#ffc107"><i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt"></i></div>
                    <div class="cc-metric-body">
                        <div class="label">Efficiency</div>
                        <div class="value" id="ccMetricEfficiency">--</div>
                        <div class="cc-metric-link"><i class="fas fa-external-link-alt me-1"></i>View dates</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card p-3 mb-3">
                <div class="cc-toolbar">
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label small fw-bold text-muted mb-1" for="ccSearch">Search</label>
                        <div class="input-group">
                            <span class="input-group-text"><i class="fas fa-search"></i></span>
                            <input id="ccSearch" type="search" class="form-control" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Name, phone, clinic, or patient transport">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label small fw-bold text-muted mb-1" for="ccPageSize">Show</label>
                        <select id="ccPageSize" class="form-select">
                            <option value="5">5</option>
                            <option value="10" selected>10</option>
                            <option value="25">25</option>
                            <option value="50">50</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <button id="ccSearchBtn" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-filter me-1"></i>Apply</button>
                    <button id="ccRefreshBtn" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" title="Refresh"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i></button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card p-0 overflow-hidden">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-3 py-3 border-bottom" style="border-color:var(--border)!important">
                    <div>
                        <div class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-list-alt me-2 text-info"></i><span id="ccListTitle">New Call Queue</span></div>
                        <div class="cc-list-subtitle" id="ccListSubtitle">Patients ready for the next call.</div>
                        <div class="cc-softphone-help mt-1" id="ccSoftphoneHelp">
                            <i class="fas fa-info-circle me-1"></i>The green phone opens MicroSIP with the number. MicroSIP must show Online before it can place the call. After the call, mark Called and Save.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-end gap-2 flex-wrap">
                        <span class="cc-phone-client-status" id="ccPhoneClientStatus"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i>Loading phone client</span>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm d-none" id="ccPhoneSetupBtn"><i class="fas fa-cog me-1"></i>Phone registration</button>
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-secondary" id="ccRangeLabel">--</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0 cc-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th class="p-0">
                                    <div class="cc-record-heading cc-record-heading-all">
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="firstName" type="button">First<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button><span class="mx-1">/</span><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="lastName" type="button">Last<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="clinicName" type="button">Clinic / Location<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="patientTransportName" type="button">Patient Transport<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="phone" type="button">Phone<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="notes" type="button">Notes<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="serviceDate" type="button">New Service Date<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell">Add Note</div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell text-center"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="status" type="button">Called<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell"><button class="cc-sort" data-sort="lastCall" type="button">Call Dates<i class="fas fa-sort"></i></button></div>
                                        <div class="cc-record-heading-cell text-end">Save</div>
                                    </div>
                                </th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="ccPatientRows">
                            <tr><td class="text-center text-muted py-4"><i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin me-2"></i>Loading</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div class="cc-pagination px-3 py-3 border-top" style="border-color:var(--border)!important">
                    <div class="text-muted small" id="ccPageLabel">--</div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <button id="ccPrevBtn" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left me-1"></i>Prev</button>
                        <button id="ccNextBtn" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">Next<i class="fas fa-chevron-right ms-1"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade cc-phone-setup-modal" id="ccPhoneSetupModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="ccPhoneSetupTitle" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <form id="ccPhoneSetupForm" autocomplete="off">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <div>
                        <h5 class="modal-title" id="ccPhoneSetupTitle"><i class="fas fa-headset me-2 text-primary"></i>RX Softphone Account</h5>
                        <div class="small text-muted mt-1">This SIP account is assigned to your RX Tracker user. Only an Administrator can change it.</div>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div class="alert alert-secondary cc-registration-message" id="ccPhoneRegistrationMessage" role="status">Checking the local softphone.</div>
                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-8">
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipServer">SIP server / PBX</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="ccSipServer" maxlength="255" placeholder="192.168.15.200" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipPort">SIP port</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control" id="ccSipPort" min="1" max="65535" value="5060" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipUsername">Extension / username</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="ccSipUsername" maxlength="128" autocomplete="username" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipDisplayName">Display name</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="ccSipDisplayName" maxlength="128" placeholder="Same as extension">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-8">
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipPassword">SIP password (leave blank to keep current)</label>
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <input type="password" class="form-control" id="ccSipPassword" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password">
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" id="ccSipPasswordToggle" aria-label="Show password">Show</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipLocalPort">Local SIP port</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control" id="ccSipLocalPort" min="0" max="65535" value="0">
                            <div class="form-text">Use 0 for automatic.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12" id="ccSipAdminPinGroup" hidden>
                            <label class="form-label" for="ccSipAdminPin"><i class="fas fa-user-shield me-1 text-primary"></i>Administrator PIN</label>
                            <input type="password" class="form-control" id="ccSipAdminPin" maxlength="128" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Administrator approval required to save changes">
                            <div class="form-text">Ask an administrator to enter the PIN. It is validated on the server and is never saved in this browser.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <div class="form-label mb-2">Supported audio codecs</div>
                            <div class="cc-codec-list" aria-label="RX Softphone supported audio codecs">
                                <span class="badge">G.711 &mu;-law (PCMU)</span>
                                <span class="badge">G.711 A-law (PCMA)</span>
                                <span class="badge">G.722</span>
                                <span class="badge">G.729</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-text">RX Softphone advertises these codecs and the PBX selects a common codec for each call.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cc-registration-security mt-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt me-1 text-success"></i>
                        RX Tracker stores this assignment on the server with the SIP password encrypted. The browser does not save it. On Call Center load, the credential is passed transiently to RX Softphone on <code>127.0.0.1</code> so the local app can register and handle audio.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer justify-content-between">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger" id="ccPhoneUnregisterBtn"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt me-1"></i>Disconnect this PC</button>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="ccPhoneRegisterBtn"><i class="fas fa-save me-1"></i>Save &amp; Connect</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="x-api-urls" aria-hidden="true" class="d-none">
    <a id="xa-base" href="/login"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-patients" href="/api/call-center/patients"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-metrics" href="/api/call-center/metrics/queue"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-lock-refresh" href="/api/call-center/locks/refresh"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-lock-release" href="/api/call-center/locks/release"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-lock-status" href="/api/call-center/locks/status"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-phone-account" href="/api/call-center/phone-account"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-phone-registration" href="/api/call-center/phone-account/registration"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-call-attempts" href="/api/call-center/call-attempts"></a>
    <a id="xa-cc-logout" href="/api/auth/logout"></a>
</div>

<div class="toast-container position-fixed top-0 end-0 p-3" style="z-index:1100"></div>
<script src="/assets/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
<script src="/js/base.js?v=<%= appBuild %>"></script>
<script src="/js/app.js?v=<%= appBuild %>"></script>
<script src="/js/call-center.js?v=<%= appBuild %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
